{"title":"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2022 AMC 10B #1</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">2022 AMC 12B #1</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(⚡️Solved_in_50_seconds⚡️)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (⚡️Solved in 50 seconds⚡️)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution(1-16)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution(1-16)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Ani_lytical\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Ani_lytical</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/c/facd9b0a167d6512bf167e2bdc04e52b35cb200f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\diamond y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"39\" height=\"13\" /> to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/2/e526fbac5ee18e20a7293e9cb9c317989b31988a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-y|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" /> for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/e/56e228943301b048f242377b3b24717037d5996f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"13\" height=\"11\" /> What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/a/30abfad2fabbf18f3fae4d47e45fdcc4bf8a8d94.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(1\\diamond(2\\diamond3))-((1\\diamond2)\\diamond3)?\\]\" width=\"208\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/2/b22fcb9b44af2c1cc068fe270482746071e3e5af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ {-}2 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ {-}1 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 0 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"379\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have \\begin{align}\n(1\\diamond(2\\diamond3))-((1\\diamond2)\\diamond3) &amp;= |1-|2-3|| - ||1-2|-3| \\\\\n&amp;= |1-1| - |1-3| \\\\\n&amp;= 0-2 \\\\\n&amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ {-}2}.\n\\end{align}\n~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Observe that the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/4/a64597fa971a2a89feef230c4a309e18d2bb0c8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\diamond$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> function is simply the positive difference between two numbers. Thus, we evaluate: the difference between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/7/02771f5b90f2023689862c2dad254ee2d26932d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" /> the difference between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/3/2c388c6a3962cdf000fa450b74cf4a13424b93c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" /> the difference between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/7/02771f5b90f2023689862c2dad254ee2d26932d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" /> the difference between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/a/64a0e77851144497c7539fe6ccfb64bad7901192.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" /> and finally, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c535c1d90a059fdb09e2ca5c0dafbc3bbacaef6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0-2=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ {-}2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"141\" height=\"30\" /> \n</p><p>~Technodoggo\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28.E2.9A.A1.EF.B8.8FSolved_in_50_seconds.E2.9A.A1.EF.B8.8F.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(⚡️Solved_in_50_seconds⚡️)\">Video Solution (⚡️Solved in 50 seconds⚡️)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (⚡️Solved in 50 seconds⚡️)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/4xOeX0aQF3U\">https://youtu.be/4xOeX0aQF3U</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution.281-16.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution(1-16)\">Video Solution(1-16)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution(1-16)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/SCwQ9jUfr0g\">https://youtu.be/SCwQ9jUfr0g</a>\n</p><p>~~Hayabusa1\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Interstigation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/_KNR0JV5rdI\">https://youtu.be/_KNR0JV5rdI</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Ani_lytical\">Video Solution by Ani_lytical</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Ani_lytical\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/gt1hUtrzdqU\">https://youtu.be/gt1hUtrzdqU</a>\n</p><p>~Ani_lytical\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B\">2022 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_A